            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.60

- Light is now the default appearance for users who have not saved an appearance preference.
- Existing Light, Dark, and Follow System choices are preserved.
- Appearance can still be changed in Settings → General → Appearance.

This release does not include a fix for the reported sustained Zoom meeting performance issue; that investigation remains open.
]]></description>
