            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.59

- Fixes native checkbox label contrast when Kiki uses Dark mode while macOS uses Light mode, including the automatic-update controls.
- Includes Light, Dark, and Follow System in Settings → General → Appearance, with a saved preference and Dark as the default.
- Includes consistent button sizing, better model-action spacing, immediate hover feedback, and steadier numeric labels from 0.6.58.
]]></description>
